(load-lain "environments/catalog-discovery.lain")
(define durable-guide "This is a fresh process. Saved Lain definitions and their captured callable dependencies have been recompiled from the local database before this request. The old process has exited. The catalog still uses the same public identities, while live cell references belong to this new session. You do not need to regenerate the earlier implementations. Discover the applicable whole-event callable in the database and resolve it. :catalog/example is a string describing a usage example, not proof. The original source is not included in your context. Source restoration does not replay old model calls or user replies.")
(define durable-search-task "Discover a restored whole-event quote network for a new event: 75 pieces at 6 currency units each, 4 labor hours at 30 per hour, with a 5% surcharge on the combined amount. Query the database for direct capability :cap/event-cost, including id, description, interface, assumptions, status and example. For direct lookup, bind an internal entity using [?cap :catalog/id :cap/example-task], join [?op :catalog/capability ?cap], then retrieve its metadata. Use rules text \"[]\"; no prerequisite traversal is needed for the whole capability. Connect rows to existing parent discovery-results with ->. Correct: (define candidates (catalog:query query-text rules-text)) (-> candidates discovery-results). Incorrect: (define discovery-results ...) shadows the parent output. Return raw Lain forms only.")
(define durable-apply-task "Use the restored whole-event callable discovered in memory-cell. Resolve its catalog id, observe its live callable through cell:value, and invoke its documented interface on quantity, unit-price, hours, hourly-rate, surcharge-rate. Connect the computed number to the existing parent answer and computed text to user-output; connect selection and applicability notes to selection-notes. Use -> for parent ports; do not redefine them. Do not reconstruct the earlier implementation. The host will change an input and verify propagation without another model request.")
(define durable-seed (add-binding seed "role-cell" (cell:reference durable-guide)))
